{#
  A generic cmake2md template.

  Available context:
    symbols   - documented function()s
    commands  - every top-level command call (option(), set(), ...)

  Both are dicts with: name, comments, group, location, filepath, line,
  pretty, and doc (the parsed comment: description, args, options, params,
  multi_params). Commands additionally carry args, the raw argument list.
#}
{% macro option_row(cmd) -%}
